## 路由 Meta

使用 `meta` 字段携带路由元信息：

```typescript
// router/types.ts
declare module 'vue-router' {
  interface RouteMeta {
    title?: string;
    requiresAuth?: boolean;
    requiresAdmin?: boolean;
    layout?: 'default' | 'admin' | 'blank';
    transition?: string;
  }
}
```

```typescript
const routes = [
  {
    path: '/dashboard',
    component: () => import('@/views/Dashboard.vue'),
    meta: {
      title: '仪表盘',
      requiresAuth: true,
      layout: 'admin',
      transition: 'fade',
    },
  },
];
```

| Meta 用途 | 说明                            |
| --------- | ------------------------------- |
| 权限控制  | `requiresAuth`、`requiresAdmin` |
| 页面标题  | `title`                         |
| 布局切换  | `layout`                        |
| 过渡动画  | `transition`                    |
| 面包屑    | `breadcrumb`                    |
| 缓存控制  | `keepAlive`                     |

---

## 路由懒加载

使用动态 `import()` 实现按需加载路由组件：

```typescript
const routes = [
  {
    path: '/',
    component: () => import('@/views/Home.vue'),
  },
  {
    path: '/about',
    component: () => import(/* webpackChunkName: "about" */ '@/views/About.vue'),
  },
  {
    path: '/admin',
    component: () => import('@/layouts/AdminLayout.vue'),
    children: [
      {
        path: 'reports',
        component: () => import('@/views/admin/Reports.vue'),
      },
    ],
  },
];
```

---

## 滚动行为

```typescript
const router = createRouter({
  history: createWebHistory(),
  routes,
  scrollBehavior(to, from, savedPosition) {
    if (savedPosition) {
      return savedPosition;
    }
    if (to.hash) {
      return { el: to.hash, behavior: 'smooth' };
    }
    return { top: 0 };
  },
});
```

---

## 动态路由

### 运行时添加/删除路由

```typescript
const router = useRouter();

function addAdminRoutes() {
  router.addRoute({
    path: '/admin',
    name: 'admin',
    component: () => import('@/layouts/AdminLayout.vue'),
    children: [
      {
        path: 'settings',
        name: 'admin-settings',
        component: () => import('@/views/AdminSettings.vue'),
      },
    ],
  });
}

function removeAdminRoutes() {
  router.removeRoute('admin');
}
```

### 动态路由参数

```typescript
const routes = [
  {
    path: '/user/:id',
    component: () => import('@/views/UserProfile.vue'),
    props: true,
  },
  {
    path: '/blog/:year(\\d{4})/:month(\\d{2})/:slug',
    component: () => import('@/views/BlogPost.vue'),
    props: true,
  },
  {
    path: '/:pathMatch(.*)*',
    name: 'NotFound',
    component: () => import('@/views/NotFound.vue'),
  },
];
```

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    URL["/user/42"]
    URL --> Match["匹配 /user/:id"]
    Match --> Props["props: { id: '42' }"]
    Props --> Component["UserProfile 组件"]
```

---

## 小结

- **导航守卫**分三层：全局（`beforeEach`/`afterEach`）、路由独享（`beforeEnter`）、组件内（`onBeforeRouteLeave`）
- `meta` 字段携带路由元信息，配合守卫实现权限控制、标题设置等功能
- 动态 `import()` 实现路由级代码分割，减小首屏包体积
- `scrollBehavior` 控制导航后的滚动位置，支持锚点和平滑滚动
- `addRoute` / `removeRoute` 支持运行时动态管理路由表，适合权限驱动的菜单
- 路由参数支持正则约束，`pathMatch` 捕获 404 路由
